"""pokegreet: a wild Pokémon encounter every time you open a terminal.

usage:
  pokegreet                 random encounter (put this in your shell rc)
  pokegreet --dex           Pokédex, shiny dex and form collection progress
  pokegreet --dex NAME      form-by-form progress for one species
  pokegreet --at DATETIME   preview an encounter at e.g. 2026-10-31T23:00 (not saved)
  pokegreet --styles        the same encounter in every display style
  pokegreet --check         validate the theme pools against your sprite data
  pokegreet --version

config:  $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/pokegreet/config.toml   (see config.example.toml)
save:    $XDG_DATA_HOME/pokegreet/dex.json
"""
